{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_028ari0294_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_028ari0294_1000_p", "source_sha256": "cab6350643d337434bd5a58f6bb4950f66bd0b956f2a89c0b62a2d84a3f49549", "ja": "（今日は亜利沙のPV撮影。そろそろゲネリハだけど、\n本人の姿が見えない……いったい何処に？）", "zh": "（今天是亚利沙的PV拍摄。马上就要进行总彩排了，可是却没看到她本人……到底去哪儿了？）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_028ari0294_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_028ari0294_1001_028ari", "source_sha256": "5824daa73c7aa389024b3061fff68f1c09fe41d7d82b221093def6ebd5f4576f", "ja": "まーだだよー……。", "zh": "还没好哦——……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_028ari0294_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_028ari0294_1002_p", "source_sha256": "2e42fbb50018f8617d7c5bd3774952e5a3262f82bd9e31f15271f3d4944b9bee", "ja": "ん？　今の声……こっちか！", "zh": "嗯？刚才的声音……在这边吗！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_028ari0294_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_028ari0294_1003_028ari", "source_sha256": "cd921038a88515627e4608ebd32a21dcac37f526017731555deb865f7929d165", "ja": "ひゃあっ！？　は、早すぎますよぉ！　まだ隠れて\nないので……って、{$P$}さん？", "zh": "呀！？太、太快了啦！我还没藏好呢……咦，{$P$}先生？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_028ari0294_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_028ari0294_1004_p", "source_sha256": "b5c606e33fcd1881d2adfcc9d4aeeaf4a55b33478bcf9a859f984c9d154dff9d", "ja": "亜利沙？　隠れてって、いったい何を……。\nあ、もしかしてまた隠し撮りとか……？", "zh": "亚利沙？你说要躲起来，到底是在躲什么……  \n啊，难道又在偷拍什么……？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_028ari0294_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_028ari0294_1005_028ari", "source_sha256": "e28e7593e87b45b7294632daaf5d8d12a32af9201689d7eb24ca290cd07b4604", "ja": "えっ、い、いや、違いますカラ！　ありさは今、\nかくれんぼをしているところなんです。", "zh": "诶，不、不是那样啦！亚利沙现在正在玩捉迷藏呢。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_028ari0294_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_028ari0294_1006_028ari", "source_sha256": "082c2fb474953628f604674dc58584e0756823f9d5129ab7ca1e8bb1786c56fb", "ja": "ほら、今日のPVに出てくれる子役の子たちがいるじゃ\nないですか。一緒に遊ぼうってお願いされちゃって。", "zh": "你看，就是那些要出演今天PV的小演员们嘛。她们拜托我陪她们一起玩。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_028ari0294_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_028ari0294_1007_p", "source_sha256": "39b5ac5eba7e98f0fad5c4706d370f5db56d7d87048aba149bf6c64bba24cd69", "ja": "あ、ああ、そうか……安心した。", "zh": "啊，啊啊，这样啊……那我就放心了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_028ari0294_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_028ari0294_1008_028ari", "source_sha256": "90d8fa5a0fe6b8a3baa2ecc9943a338be26d2503d33569ec47982336899272f3", "ja": "あ、もちろん、軽く物陰に隠れる程度ですよ？\n撮影前に、衣装を汚すわけにはいきません！", "zh": "啊，当然只是稍微躲到遮挡物后面而已哦？\n在拍摄前，可不能把服装弄脏！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_028ari0294_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_028ari0294_1009_028ari", "source_sha256": "b4129d2b95d6744e8037dc299019de9810c4447c65bab4cc0424506501ce7351", "ja": "だから隠れ場所がなかなか見つからなくて、\nずっと負け続けてますケド……えへへ。", "zh": "所以一直找不到合适的藏身处，结果一直输个不停……嘿嘿。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_028ari0294_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_028ari0294_1010_p", "source_sha256": "66dc186eacbcf248a8c6fb14196e0009d4e0316d466a7e5a55442def409fa68e", "ja": "そうか、その心構えはありがたいよ。\nにしても、ずいぶん子役の子たちと仲良しなんだな。", "zh": "这样啊，你有这份心态真是难得。  \n不过，你和那些小演员们关系还真好啊。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_028ari0294_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_028ari0294_1011_028ari", "source_sha256": "0beb364e4eff44006b81c414d233aa481bec9272e72a13cd00cd5fcd6c87c7da", "ja": "はい！　ありさの方からご挨拶させていただきました！\n子役と言えば、未来の大スターですから。", "zh": "是的！是由有纱主动向他们打招呼的！\n说到童星，那可是未来的大明星呢。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_028ari0294_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_028ari0294_1012_028ari", "source_sha256": "e8b5ea87ea8dd78e726ba1fe7b15295567cfb7daca26b5d48c61d69bcacc8f2d", "ja": "ホントにみなさん、キュートでカワイくて……。\nありさ、将来が楽しみでなりませんっ！", "zh": "大家真的都又可爱又惹人喜欢……  \n真让阿利莎对未来期待不已！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_028ari0294_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_028ari0294_1013_028ari", "source_sha256": "40bdab5981e85ba2d7a255ca93871039312fe386fda6a75245d65d9fcf943a03", "ja": "今のうちに、お近づきになっておかなくては……。\nムフ、ムフフ……♪", "zh": "趁现在得赶紧和大家搞好关系才行……。\n嘿嘿，嘿嘿嘿……♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_028ari0294_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_028ari0294_1014_p", "source_sha256": "dd414a3e02b759a8563a437985e575d0b5d65255d4945e096afb3f350898a91b", "ja": "そうか……ほどほどにな。", "zh": "这样啊……适可而止吧。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_028ari0294_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_028ari0294_1015_028ari", "source_sha256": "ebb6ab085e8e1c2895b42439f2f2fa0ba0433d7436b8bd1bfb4a33f4bce53bc3", "ja": "そうそう、アイドルに興味があるっていう子もいて、\nお話しました。キラキラした目で聞いてくれて……。", "zh": "对了，还有个孩子说对偶像很感兴趣，\n我就和她聊了聊。她用闪闪发亮的眼睛听着……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_028ari0294_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_028ari0294_1016_028ari", "source_sha256": "45adf996f7b411b299437edf003aad6bd391535a9b63871badd22ac83a6cc8e4", "ja": "もしかしたらありさ、新たなアイドルちゃんの\n誕生に立ち会ったのカモ……？　ふ、ふおぉぉ～っ！", "zh": "说不定，亚利沙还亲眼见证了新的偶像诞生……？呜、呜哦哦哦～！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_028ari0294_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_028ari0294_1017_p", "source_sha256": "49bf1441eff510512949ce66c88d111cdafd70390045b047b5e1951f874d3205", "ja": "それは、本当にそうかもしれないぞ。\n元子役のアイドルって言うのは、ない話じゃないし。", "zh": "那还真有可能是这样。童星出身的偶像，也不是没有先例。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_028ari0294_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_028ari0294_1018_p", "source_sha256": "a6e2ff554beb5e16587726b9ce4f7d5f51d552a8477bd500a1cd845b111beeca", "ja": "もしかしたらその子にとって、一番の憧れの\nアイドルは、亜利沙って事になるのかもしれないな。", "zh": "说不定对那个孩子来说，最憧憬的偶像就是亜利沙也说不定啊。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_028ari0294_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_028ari0294_1019_028ari", "source_sha256": "655b92f404778adae7d00d3f5748ca8ce1ca39e0025a2714f2a42a80093fa7b2", "ja": "ええっ！？　そんな、ありさなんかが、\n憧れだなんて……。あ、あまりにも恐れ多いですよぉ！", "zh": "诶！？怎么会，像亚利沙这样的，竟然会成为憧憬对象……这、这也太不敢当了吧！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_028ari0294_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_028ari0294_1020_028ari", "source_sha256": "f257365716cd131a83e374212dd8c7aa7f4b9ec87c8f31c00de0165a53998226", "ja": "で、でもでも、もしそう言ってくれる子がいたら……。\nありさ、すっごく幸せかもです……えへへっ♪", "zh": "但、但是，如果有孩子愿意这么说的话……亚利沙可能会超级幸福……诶嘿嘿♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_028ari0294_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_028ari0294_1021_koyaku", "source_sha256": "1e014ddcfb4a71726e03fd8f0dd74edfa53e87731cf64eac65e988764c751ad8", "ja": "あっ！　ありさお姉ちゃん、みーつけたっ！\n次はお姉ちゃんが鬼ね♪", "zh": "啊！找到亚利沙姐姐了！\n接下来姐姐来当鬼哦♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_028ari0294_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_028ari0294_1022_028ari", "source_sha256": "915ca9d96a4a72c83a754ccf0f65870e99d1a812da09c3bb940cc688e2387027", "ja": "わっ！　{$P$}さんと\nお話してたら、見つかっちゃいました！", "zh": "哇！光顾着跟{$P$}先生\n聊天，结果被找到了！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_028ari0294_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_028ari0294_1023_028ari", "source_sha256": "32a491ad7205c8735bb87e8e92afca0fd4178169b5ca7817a04ee7987d90ba7f", "ja": "それじゃあ次は、撮影場所まで鬼ごっこですよぉ！\nほーら、待て待て～♪　ムフフ……。", "zh": "那么接下来，就来玩追人游戏，一直跑到拍摄地点吧！\n来呀，别跑别跑～♪　嘻嘻……。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_028ari0294_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_028ari0294_1024_p", "source_sha256": "495e2a5f348e04e71c45a169b97d89c34062d33c2ca5b8f17e804e345be818a8", "ja": "（亜利沙がこれほど子ども受けするとは、\n少し意外だったかもな……いい映像になりそうだ）", "zh": "（没想到亜利沙居然这么受孩子们欢迎，\n还真有点意外……应该能拍出不错的影像。）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
